treacherous world filled with wild animals, ancient magic, and dangerous foes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1297900/extras/032c4917db8a10b887dd6b653d55ec99.poster.avif?t=1754078382\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1297900/extras/032c4917db8a10b887dd6b653d55ec99.webm?t=1754078382\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1297900/extras/032c4917db8a10b887dd6b653d55ec99.mp4?t=1754078382\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div> </p>",
